-18T12:44:12Z"},{"number":394,"title":"[Bug]: Mods won't load after enhancing Wand","comments":5,"created_at":"2026-11-06T17:30:38Z"},{"number":119,"title":"[Bug]: Pro removes itself","comments":6,"created_at":"2026-06-28T23:32:49Z"},{"number":362,"title":"[Bug]:  21 Mods don't work!!","comments":3,"created_at":"2026-10-22T19:29:54Z"},{"number":278,"title":"Workaround: Wand is not opening after patching on WeMod versions newer than 12.50","comments":4,"created_at":"2026-09-05T09:52:11Z"},{"number":194,"title":"[Bug]: Wand automatically logging out after enhancing","comments":4,"created_at":"2026-08-16T06:34:06Z"}],"discussions":[{"number":408,"title":"So what now? How can we get/build the app now? What should we do? How can we update our wand echancer?","comments":1,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2026-11-13T06:53:36Z"},{"number":403,"title":"Wand Enhancer Question","comments":1,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2026-11-11T19:14:49Z"},{"number":391,"title":"Appsettings","comments":0,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2026-11-06T11:29:35Z"},{"number":390,"title":"wand 12.69 has trouble w loading mods","comments":3,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2026-11-05T20:20:14Z"},{"number":385,"title":"bonjour votre logiciel fonctionne pas","comments":0,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-11-03T19:32:13Z"},{"number":380,"title":"Bitdefender and Windows defender flagged Wand Enhancer and quarantine.","comments":2,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-11-01T01:25:35Z"},{"number":376,"title":"Enhanced Wand 12.68.0 won't open anymore","comments":2,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2026-10-30T23:32:15Z"},{"number":375,"title":"i had error but did this","comments":1,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-10-30T14:50:12Z"}],"latest_release":{"name":"2.2.1.0","tag":"2.2.1.0","published_at":"2026-11-04T10:39:03Z","body":"### Features\r\n\r\n- The patch dialog now remembers your last choices (patches, method, auto-apply, custom scripts), and the main window remembers the Wand install. By @w0wzahh in #387.\r\n- A Re-detect button next to the install path rescans the current install after a Wand update, without restarting the app. By @w0wzahh in #387.\r\n- A Copy diagnostics button next to the log copies the enhancer version, OS, install path, Wand version and patch state, ready to paste into a bug report. By @w0wzahh in #387.\r\n\r\n### Fixes\r\n\r\n- Fixed the patcher targeting an old Wand version after an update. The latest install was chosen by the folder's modification time, which a virus scan or the enhancer's own backup can bump on the previous version. It is now chosen by the version in the folder name. By @w0wzahh in #383. #374\r\n- Restore now removes the deployed `WandEnhancerWatcher.exe`, and a file that is still locked is skipped with a warning instead of failing the Restore. By @w0wzahh in #386.\r\n- The log now warns when a newer Wand version sits next to the selected one. By @w0wzahh in #386. #374\r\n- Fixed the web tests failing on a source ZIP download, which stopped the build at \"Test web-panel\". #384\r\n","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[{"title":"Wand-Enhancer 怎么搭建？开源 Wand 客户端增强与远程控制工具介绍","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/tedcloud123/article/details/164738109","source":"blog.csdn","lang":"zh","date":"2026-09-09"},{"title":"k1tbyte Wand Surged on GitHub, but Compatibility Is Its Real Test","url":"https://www.remio.ai/post/k1tbyte-wand-surged-on-github-but-compatibility-is-its-real-test","source":"remio.ai","lang":"en","date":"2026-08-31"},{"title":"k1tbyte Wand, GitHub에서 급상승했지만 진짜 시험대는 호환성","url":"https://www.remio.ai/ko/post/k1tbyte-wand-surged-on-github-but-compatibility-is-its-real-test-ko","source":"remio.ai","lang":"en","date":"2026-08-31"},{"title":"Wand-Enhancer：三分钟解锁Wand专业版的完整游戏修改体验","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/gitblog_01062/article/details/163332056","source":"blog.csdn","lang":"zh","date":"2026-08-15"}],"stale":false,"snapshot_at":"2026-11-14T08:50:43Z","history_start":"2026-09-06"}